    "ACCDetails": "Strategic Vision of the Accounting and Auditing Program:\n\nThe Accounting and Auditing Program at Raya Institute is committed to producing graduates who are knowledgeable, skilled, and ethically committed, capable of competing in the local and regional job market, and producing scientific research that contributes to enhancing the role of accounting in achieving sustainable development goals.\n\nMission of the Accounting and Auditing Program:\n\nThe mission of the Accounting and Auditing Program at Raya Institute is to contribute effectively to building intellectual capital, developing skills, and refining professional competencies in the accounting, administrative, and economic fields to meet the demands of the Egyptian, Arab, and African markets, and to serve development issues and solve their problems, while continuously improving the quality of the inputs and outputs of the educational process and research activities in accordance with international quality standards.\n\nObjectives of the Accounting and Auditing Program:\n\nFirst: To prepare qualified personnel with the appropriate and sufficient training to assume the responsibilities of the profession as accountants or auditors in the government sector, the public business sector, and the private sector, based on the needs of society.\n\nSecond: Developing the department's educational program to keep pace with technological advancements and the increasing use of computers in operating accounting information systems in the public and private sectors.\n\nThird: Enhancing teaching performance to meet the department's future needs by attracting distinguished academic talent, expanding the recruitment of academically outstanding graduates as teaching assistants, and sending them abroad to pursue postgraduate studies at leading universities.\n\nFourth: Contributing to efforts to develop the accounting and auditing profession through collaboration with official professional bodies in regulating professional practices.\n\nDuration of study at the institute: Four academic years.\n\nRaya Higher Institute awards a Bachelor of Science degree in Accounting, equivalent to a Bachelor of Commerce degree specializing in Accounting, granted by Egyptian universities subject to Law No. 49 of 1972 Regulating Universities and its executive regulations. The degree is accredited by the Minister of Higher Education and its equivalence is confirmed by the Supreme Council of Universities.\n\nStudents holding the following qualifications are accepted into this program:\n\n1- General Secondary Education Certificate (both sections) and equivalent Arab and foreign certificates\n2- Three-year Commercial Secondary Education Certificate\n3- Technical Secondary Education Certificate for Administration and Services\n4- Diploma from Technical Commercial Institutes (for admission to the second year)\n5- Diploma from Institutes of Management and Secretarial Studies (for admission to the second year)\n6- Five-year Commercial Secondary Education Certificate",
