    "terms_con": "\n        \"1. Introduction\nWelcome to My Raya, the official application of Raya Higher Institute for Management and Foreign Trade in New Damietta. This app aims to enhance the experience of students and faculty members through advanced electronic services.\nBy using the app, you fully agree to comply with these terms and conditions.\n\n2. Scope of Use\nThe app is only permitted for use by authorized students, faculty, and staff of Raya Institute.\nThe app is for academic and administrative purposes only.\nUse by any unauthorized person is strictly prohibited.\n\n3. Security and Account Protection\nThe user is responsible for maintaining account confidentiality.\nSharing login credentials with third parties is prohibited.\nThe institute reserves the right to suspend or cancel accounts in case of terms violation or misuse.\n\n4. Prohibition of Root and App Cloning\nRunning the app on rooted (Root) or jailbroken (Jailbreak) devices is prohibited as these may compromise user data security.\nUsing any apps or tools to clone or emulate the app (such as unofficial cloning software) is prohibited.\nIf such methods are detected, the institute reserves the right to take legal action against violators, including account suspension or filing complaints.\n\n5. Data Collection and Privacy\nThe app collects necessary personal data like name, email, university ID, and academic performance records to improve service quality.\nAll data is handled confidentially according to the institute's privacy policies and is not shared with external parties except as required by law.\n\n6. Content and Services\nThe app provides various services including schedules, exam results, academic announcements, and communication with administration.\nThe institute reserves the right to modify or temporarily/permanently discontinue any service without prior notice.\n\n7. Prohibited Behavior\nPosting or sharing offensive or inappropriate content is prohibited.\nAttempting to hack the app or manipulate its data is prohibited.\nUsing the app for commercial or illegal purposes is prohibited.\n\n8. Terms Modifications\nThe institute reserves the right to modify these terms at any time, and users will be notified of changes through the app or official communication channels. Continued use implies acceptance of modified terms.\n\n9. Termination of Use\nUsers may close their accounts at any time.\nThe institute may suspend or delete accounts violating the terms.\n\n10. Disclaimer\nServices are provided \"as is\" without warranties. The institute is not liable for direct/indirect damages from app use, including data loss or service interruption.\n\n11. Geographical Restrictions\nApp use or access is prohibited from EU countries, UK, and USA.\nIf accidentally registered from these regions, users may contact us via email to request data deletion:\nrayaedu2@gmail.com\n\n12. Governing Law and Dispute Resolution\nThese terms are governed by Egyptian law, and any disputes shall be resolved before competent Egyptian courts.\n\n13. Intellectual Property Rights\nAll intellectual property rights related to the app, including logos, designs, and content, are exclusively owned by Raya Higher Institute.\nCopying, modifying, or republishing any part without prior written permission is prohibited.\n\n14. Contact and Support\nFor inquiries or complaints, please contact:\nEmail: rayaedu2@gmail.com\nAddress: Raya Higher Institute for Management and Foreign Trade - New Damietta.\"\n    ",
